 "text": "Hey there, how are you? You can use a cable wrap or a pen holder cable feeder. The wrap is neat but it fills up fast. The feeder works with most pens. It' called a pen feeder and it takes cables for ballpoint pens. You slip it over the cables before they disappear. Not really. You cut cable length off, slip the feeder on, and wrap it off. It only takes a minute.",
